{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411190","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1441119001:1":{"text":"能从平民中被选拔为卫兵，再被选为卫队长是很幸运的事。","source_cn":"能从平民中被选拔为卫兵，再被选为卫队长是很幸运的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD908A69BFAE43AFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441119002:1":{"text":"沙利叶一直很看好我……虽然不清楚为什么，但我感谢他给我的机会。","source_cn":"沙利叶一直很看好我……虽然不清楚为什么，但我感谢他给我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB9539F65F14553B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441119003:1":{"text":"如果不是他允许选拔平民成为卫兵，多给了平民一条路，现在的我会是王城里一名普通的仆从。","source_cn":"如果不是他允许选拔平民成为卫兵，多给了平民一条路，现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB95720BB3A0A96FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1441119003":{"text":"如果不是他允许选拔平民成为卫兵，多给了平民一条路，现在的我会是王城里一名普通的仆从。","source_cn":"如果不是他允许选拔平民成为卫兵，多给了平民一条路，现在的我会是王城里一名普通的仆从。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB95720BB3A0A96FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1441119004:1":{"text":"每个适龄的平民青年都不会放过这样的机会，要挤破头为自己抢一个位置。","source_cn":"每个适龄的平民青年都不会放过这样的机会，要挤破头为自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C976DD8CAF80FBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1441119005:1":{"text":"当年选拔的时候，我的一位同伴决斗输给了我。","source_cn":"当年选拔的时候，我的一位同伴决斗输给了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F40F458ED4EDB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1441119006:1":{"text":"他先是质问我，为什么要抢走他珍惜已久的机会，后来又让我带着他那份走下去。","source_cn":"他先是质问我，为什么要抢走他珍惜已久的机会，后来又让我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D0EB11A62C324A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1441119006":{"text":"他先是质问我，为什么要抢走他珍惜已久的机会，后来又让我带着他那份走下去。","source_cn":"他先是质问我，为什么要抢走他珍惜已久的机会，后来又让我带着他那份走下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D0EB11A62C324A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1441119007:1":{"text":"当上卫兵后，他们的眼神变成了仇恨。","source_cn":"当上卫兵后，他们的眼神变成了仇恨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3DA3A0F7874AD2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1441119008:1":{"text":"驱逐平民，追捕逃奴，处置孽化同胞……卫兵做的是这样的工作。","source_cn":"驱逐平民，追捕逃奴，处置孽化同胞……卫兵做的是这样的工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD64ED0DBA7683EC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1441119009:1":{"text":"卫队教给我，为了王国的安全和多数人的利益，牺牲必然存在。","source_cn":"卫队教给我，为了王国的安全和多数人的利益，牺牲必然存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF164F40FA6B38BDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1441119010:1":{"text":"但那些仇恨不是虚假的。","source_cn":"但那些仇恨不是虚假的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05688ECABF5DFF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1441119010":{"text":"但那些仇恨不是虚假的。","source_cn":"但那些仇恨不是虚假的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05688ECABF5DFF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1441119011:1":{"text":"成为卫队长后，平民对我的态度缓和了不少。","source_cn":"成为卫队长后，平民对我的态度缓和了不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x589A3933B2D18DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1441119012:1":{"text":"或许是因为，规则限度内，我会酌情考虑他们的请求和难处。","source_cn":"或许是因为，规则限度内，我会酌情考虑他们的请求和难处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07501906F5982875","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1441119013:1":{"text":"更多的刁难来自贵族，沙利叶把许多他的本职工作交给了我，施行超出职权的事常常会惹恼贵族。","source_cn":"更